            ("Replace phrasal verb with formal Latinate verb", "We will set up a new training programme next quarter.", "We will establish a new training programme next quarter."),
            ("Eradicate conversational slang", "The delivery driver was fed up with waiting around all morning.", "The delivery driver expressed frustration regarding extended waiting times throughout the morning.")
